                                                "sense_id": "6730d250-25ab-3226-b559-80c983575357",
                                                "text": "Payload packaging considerations are of great importance and tend to favor low L/D vehicles since these have open leesides with good view factors for radiators and antennae (Ref. 33)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bb69bf6-e7fc-4d37-a7af-ee5d0a7a51ed",
                                                "sense_id": "6730d250-25ab-3226-b559-80c983575357",
                                                "text": "The leeside slope angle of these dunes (Figure 19.8d) shows a wide spread from 1 to 58° (steeper than than the angle-of-repose probably due to intense eddying in the leeside), with a mean of 8.4°."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb821a66-030f-43e9-a29b-5f555d92efef",
                                                "sense_id": "6730d250-25ab-3226-b559-80c983575357",
                                                "text": "Therefore, in steady conditions, a mean wave set-up is established on the leeside of the structure."
